{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8019","id":5221591276,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNzso7A","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8019","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8019.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8019.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8019","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8019/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8019/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8019/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/aec0f64d4d8edee3c71a6b254f7bc78f8e0defc5","number":8019,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"mcpx: one script-resolution rule for CLI and daemon — /v1/exec resolves names (#2168)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #2168.\n\nRevival of PR #2586 (closed unmerged) onto current main — task 14339, follow-on of triage task 7863, which verified the issue still live at main and scoped this fix path.\n\n## What\n- resolveScript logic moves to the new shared package internal/scriptresolve, used by both the CLI (internal/cli) and the daemon path (internal/execsvc + internal/daemon /v1/exec) — no forked copies.\n- POST /v1/exec with a bare file name (e.g. \"report\") now resolves it on the daemon's search path; a miss errors naming every directory searched.\n- CLI --remote default unchanged (resolve locally, send text); new --remote-file form asks the daemon to resolve.\n- docs/exec.md documents the --remote-file form.\n- The #1919 paths.scripts scope question: answered — the daemon reads the same paths.scripts setting as the CLI (no daemon-specific list); recorded in code comments in routes_exec.go / execsvc.go.\n\n## Revival fixes vs the #2586 branch\n- Module path updated: github.com/dezren39/mcpx -> github.com/developing-today/code/pkgs/mcpx.\n- Cherry-pick conflicts merged with current main's newer work: CLI dryRun flag and daemon ConfigDir/Calls (from the #2611 review) kept alongside remoteFile/Scripts.\n- Bug fix: the old branch's scriptresolve.Extensions dropped .py, silently breaking name resolution for Python scripts — restored to .ts, .mts, .js, .mjs, .py. A plausible cause of the basic:test failure that blocked #2586.\n\n## Verification (laptop, this branch @ aec0f64d4d)\n- go build ./... — pass.\n- go test ./... in pkgs/mcpx — all 51 packages pass, including new daemon-resolution tests in internal/scriptresolve and internal/execsvc mirroring the CLI resolveScript tests.\n\nOracle: the acceptance criteria on #2168, plus pre-existing CLI resolution behavior (extension order incl. .py last) preserved by the shared list.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T09:23:05Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:42:16Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T09:24:14Z","merg